ief priest of Kotomusubi shrine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unable to keep up with his sister's advances, he ends up asking for divine intervention, only to end up being courted by a Goddess instead!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Our protagonist is between a rock and a hard place. What will he do?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80974"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0b8311cdf61e7f1fa9076921f921c4492c1b2395b7aae05b7ec62786ab82a99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e737736b72fbf50ab10781e3dd6256ce86f01559a4588d1919d07972ffc2cdf3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80975","characterName":"円藤 美代","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80975"},"originalCharacterName":"円藤 美代","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's loving (self proclaimed) big sister, perhaps a bit TOO loving at times!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her position as sister is put to the test due to Yui's arrival, and a fierce rivalry ensues."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A tradition of Kotomusubi states that all shrine maidens should be cross-dressing males in order to not anger the Goddess, Mishiro is one of such maidens."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For Mishiro, marrying the protagonist is as certain as shooting fish in a barrel."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80975"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/461766b7d8cf3f442bd10a77eeedd799b69ae1a0c380e48858f911c3c3e5e124.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a39983bfc7b1315541fa9e2a93615b47ebcd0c4f1be4f8fe5a57aaaf3115c4f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘 美月","creatorId":"vndb:s4602","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4602","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4602","name":"橘 美月","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80960","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80976","characterName":"結","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80976"},"originalCharacterName":"結","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Goddess sealed inside Kotomusubi shrine's cave."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She wields the power to create and strengthen bonds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The gods of heaven were afraid she might cause chaos in the world, so they sealed her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It took our protagonist's heartfelt wish and a bit of magic to bring her back to this world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seeing the reincarnation of her past love in him, she immediately proclaimed herself as the protagonist's wife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her true name is Kotomusubi Himegami-no-Mikoto."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Not a woman, but a trap Goddess."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is Tamaki's older sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80976"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/7150cbba68a91776d046a62873ae6aecb75eabed81c88dc2148e97361036c80b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de71bacc878ba0ef73cc9796a35b4346ae736d9c5903c321ea00f2880bbd8373.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"麻黒 ほん","creatorId":"vndb:s3372","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3372","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3372","name":"麻黒ほん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80959","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80977","characterName":"緋和","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80977"},"originalCharacterName":"緋和","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The incarnation of the Komainu enshrined at Kotomusubi Shrine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A glorified errand boy for the gods, so his power isn't particularly exceptional, and despite his usual clumsiness he still claims to be a powerful God."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His original role is to watch over the sealed Goddess, but since the shrine's going through rough times, he took up a part-time job as a shrine maiden."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a bit of a scatterbrain on all fronts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinowa has a bit of a sweet tooth, and is accustomed to being fed Mishiro's peerless cuisine."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80977"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93a469d810cf40f7e30aae6d0bc961953eb51a8820c1e4aa02bbb63cce33dcae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe90930f08652fc85d96f2fe72ee61c6bb5faeaf6d4614855d80d2c4be390748.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"スズナ","creatorId":"vndb:s13137","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13137","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13137","name":"スズナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80961","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91873","characterName":"環","sourceIds":{"vndbCha